{"id":518,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It drowses and dreams all the time. It’s best to leave it be if it’s just woken up, as it’s a terrible grump when freshly roused from sleep."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"When dark mists emanate from its body, don’t get too near. If you do, your nightmares will become reality."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"The dream mist coming from its forehead changes into many different colors depending on the dream that was eaten."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Black"],"text":"The mist emanating from their foreheads is packed with the dreams of people and Pokémon."},{"games":["White"],"text":"With the mist from its forehead, it can create shapes of things from dreams it has eaten."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Forewarn","hidden":false,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can tell one of the moves an opposing Pokémon has."},{"name":"Synchronize","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon is burned, paralyzed, or poisoned by another Pokémon, that Pokémon will be inflicted with the same status condition."},{"name":"Telepathy","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon anticipates and dodges the attacks of its allies."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":10,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":null,"color":"Pink","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":517,"name":"Munna","condition":null,"children":[{"id":518,"name":"Musharna","condition":"Use Moon Stone","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,60],[1,94],[1,95],[1,111],[1,138],[1,236],[1,248],[1,277],[1,281],[1,286],[1,347],[1,428],[1,472],[1,500],[1,585],[1,678]],"machine":[502,133,213,347,605,203,412,263,248,416,385,360,270,63,286,113,384,182,94,678,473,240,115,156,157,317,496,219,247,285,214,173,500,164,129,86,271,433,472,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[797,802]},"cards":[{"id":"zsv10pt5-117","name":"Musharna","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"117","artist":"M